             <h2 style= "color : #e40046; margin-left: 490px;">Our Team, Our Story </h2>
             <br>
             <p style ="margin-left: 390px;"> 
               We are a team of engineering students wanting to put our skills into building something that can be useful in the development of the society.  </p>
             <p style ="margin-left: 390px;">We have developed a web application to channel efficient communication between NGO's and volunteers. Through VRNGO, various NGOs as well as volunteers can post about events, 
                or connect to each other through posts.
                 This becomes very helpful because often people willing to help don't know whom to approach, similarly NGOs don't know where to search for volunteers. 
